comment on column SP_PERSON_DETAILS_V.PROJ_CONTRIB_COMMENT_COUNT is 'Number of comments the person has contributed to projects';
comment on column SP_PERSON_DETAILS_V.INITIATIVE_CONTRIB_COMMENT_COUNT is 'Number of comments the person has contributed to initiatives';
comment on column SP_PERSON_DETAILS_V.RELEASE_CONTRIB_COMMENT_COUNT is 'Number of comments the person has contributed to releases';
